</p>

<p style="font-size:13px;color:#666;text-align:center">https://wpfw.mohrss.gov.cn/foreigner/renewal</p>

<p style="font-size:12px;color:#888;text-align:center">(Company HR account login required. First-time users will need to register with the company's Unified Social Credit Code.)</p>

